  "abstract": "This technical note provides an external analytical scaffold for the six PASC F0 criteria that remain NOT_SATISFIED in PASC Foundation Gate v0.1.1 Recovery Build 5. It provides structural templates and a dependency-aware work order without modifying Recovery Build 5 or supplying closure evidence, human independence, competent-jurisdiction authority, field observations, implementation authorization, deployment authorization, or F0 passage.",
